## Context Health

- Each compaction retains only 20-30% of detail
- After 2 compactions: write handoff, start new session
- Use sub-agents for research to protect context window

## Error Protocol

Never retry same approach 3x. Check: LEARNINGS.md -> docs -> web search.
After every fix: What broke? Root cause? Rule to prevent recurrence? -> append to LEARNINGS.md.

